{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22471","headline":"东溪种柳 · 白居易","name":"东溪种柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野性爱栽植，植柳水中坻。\n乘春持斧斫，裁截而树之。\n长短既不一，高下随所宜。\n倚岸埋大干，临流插小枝。\n松柏不可待，楩柟固难移。\n不如种此树，此树易荣滋。\n无根亦可活，成阴况非迟。\n三年未离郡，可以见依依。\n种罢水边憩，仰头闲自思。\n富贵本非望，功名须待时。\n不种东溪柳，端坐欲何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}